From c6de3d9812daed4b01227fe220ffcf80c3fe5882 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:55:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] proto(s2a-p1): ProgramCorrespondence fiber_partition
 through dest

AdmittedStatement.fiber_partition's case split now on the dest-composed
predicate; Permutation and Program were already destination-generic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 leanncd/LeanNCD/Semantics/Source/ProgramCorrespondence.lean | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/leanncd/LeanNCD/Semantics/Source/ProgramCorrespondence.lean b/leanncd/LeanNCD/Semantics/Source/ProgramCorrespondence.lean
index 4f8b5995..5f2a031f 100644
--- a/leanncd/LeanNCD/Semantics/Source/ProgramCorrespondence.lean
+++ b/leanncd/LeanNCD/Semantics/Source/ProgramCorrespondence.lean
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ theorem AdmittedStatement.fiber_partition (statement : AdmittedStatement source)
       rw [ih, term.fiber_partition, ← Finset.sum_add_distrib]
       apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
       intro x _
-      by_cases h : statement.output.slots.project x = p <;>
+      by_cases h : statement.output.dest (statement.output.slots.project x) = p <;>
         simp [AdmittedStatement.destination, h]
   exact linear statement.terms
 
